@startuml FLEXT-gRPC Data Flow Diagram

title FLEXT-gRPC Data Flow and Processing

actor "FLEXT Developer" as developer
participant "Application Code" as app
participant "FLEXT-gRPC API" as api
participant "Service Layer" as service
participant "Domain Entities" as domain
participant "Protocol Buffers" as protobuf
participant "gRPC Channel" as channel
participant "External Service" as external

== Request Initiation ==
developer -> app: Call FLEXT-gRPC API
app -> api: create_client() or create_server()

== Configuration Processing ==
api -> service: Instantiate service with settings
service -> domain: Create domain entities
domain -> protobuf: Validate message schemas

== Connection Establishment ==
api -> channel: Establish gRPC connection
channel -> external: Open network connection
external --> channel: Connection acknowledged
channel --> api: Connection ready

== Data Transmission ==
app -> api: Send request data
api -> service: Process business logic
service -> domain: Apply domain rules
domain -> protobuf: Serialize to protobuf
protobuf -> channel: Send over gRPC
channel -> external: Transmit data

== Response Processing ==
external --> channel: Send response data
channel --> protobuf: Receive protobuf data
protobuf --> domain: Deserialize to domain objects
domain --> service: Apply business rules
service --> api: Return processed result
api --> app: Deliver to application

== Error Handling ==
external --> channel: Error response
channel --> protobuf: Error serialization
protobuf --> domain: Domain error creation
domain --> service: Error propagation
service --> api: r.Failure()
api --> app: Error handling

== Cleanup ==
app -> api: Close connection
api -> service: Shutdown services
service -> domain: Clean up entities
domain -> channel: Close connections
channel -> external: Disconnect

@enduml
